GPIO_TP_018	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_write_read_intr_en1	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Write all 6 data patterns to gp0_intr1_intr_en1 register and read back. Verify all 32 interrupt enable bits (G8-G39) are writable and readable.	gp0_intr1_intr_en1	0x84	32	G8_intr_en to G39_intr_en	0-31	RW	0	NA	hreset_n	Write+Read	0xFFFFFFFF	0xFFFFFFFF	Pattern-dependent	0xFFFFFFFF, 0xAAAAAAAA, 0x55555555, 0xF5F5F5F5, 0xA5A5A5A5, 0xFFFF0000	For each pattern: read_data must equal (pattern & write_mask & read_mask). PASS if all 6 patterns match.	High	Register Write-Read	Full 32-bit RW register. All bits writable. Interrupt enable for GPIO_8 to GPIO_39 via intr1.
