GPIO_TP_020	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_read_only_check	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify that read-only registers (intr_sts1, intr_sts2, din_group) cannot be written. Write patterns and confirm original values are retained.	gp0_intr1_intr_sts1	0x88	32	G8_intr_sts to G39_intr_sts	0-31	RO	0	gpio	hreset_n	Read	0x00000000	0xFFFFFFFF	0x00000000	NA	Write_mask is 0x00000000. Register is skipped during write phase. Read must always return reset value. PASS if read returns 0x00000000.	Medium	Read-Only Verification	Confirms RO behavior. Also applies to gp0_intr2_intr_sts1(0x90), gpio_din_group1-4 (0xB4,0xB8,0xBC,0xC0).
GPIO_TP_021	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_vrrw_skip_check	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify VRRW (Virtual Read-Read-Write) registers are correctly skipped during write-read test per skip_array configuration.	gpio_intr_raw_stclr1	0x80	32	G8_intr_raw_stclr to G39_intr_raw_stclr	0-31	VRRW	0	gpio	hreset_n	Skip	0xFFFFFFFF	0xFFFFFFFF	NA	NA	Register is marked skip_array[32]=1. Test must skip this register during write-read phase. PASS if no write attempted.	Medium	Skip Verification	VRRW registers (0x80,0x94,0x98,0x9C,0xA0,0xA4,0xA8,0xAC,0xB0) are skipped per skip_array to avoid side effects.
GPIO_TP_022	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_io_ctrl_field	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify io_ctrl field (bit 20) in per-pin GPIO registers. Write 0 to set output mode, write 1 to set input mode. Confirm field is RW2 type with source module gpio.	gp0_gpio_8	0x00	32	io_ctrl	20	RW2	1	gpio	hreset_n	Write+Read	0x00100000	0x00100000	0x00100000	0x00000000, 0x00100000	Write 0 to io_ctrl: GPIO set to output mode. Write 1: GPIO set to input mode. Default is 1 (input). PASS if field toggles correctly.	High	Functional Field Test	RW2 type: read returns value from hardware (gpio source module). io_ctrl controls GPIO direction for each pin.
GPIO_TP_023	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_dout_field	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify dout field (bit 21) in per-pin GPIO registers. Write value to be driven on GPIO pin in output mode. Confirm field is RW2 type with source module gpio.	gp0_gpio_8	0x00	32	dout	21	RW2	0	gpio	hreset_n	Write+Read	0x00200000	0x00200000	0x00000000	0x00200000, 0x00000000	Write 1 to dout: GPIO pin driven high in output mode. Write 0: GPIO pin driven low. Default is 0. PASS if field toggles correctly.	High	Functional Field Test	RW2 type: read returns value from hardware (gpio source module). dout drives GPIO pin output value.
GPIO_TP_024	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_pedge_intr_en_field	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify pedge_intr_en field (bit 17) in per-pin GPIO registers. Enable/disable positive edge interrupt detection on GPIO pin.	gp0_gpio_8	0x00	32	pedge_intr_en	17	RW	0	NA	hreset_n	Write+Read	0x00020000	0x00020000	0x00000000	0x00020000, 0x00000000	Write 1: Enable interrupt on rising edge. Write 0: Disable. Default is 0. PASS if field toggles correctly.	High	Functional Field Test	Standard RW field. Controls positive edge interrupt enable per GPIO pin.
GPIO_TP_025	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_nedge_intr_en_field	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify nedge_intr_en field (bit 18) in per-pin GPIO registers. Enable/disable negative edge interrupt detection on GPIO pin.	gp0_gpio_8	0x00	32	nedge_intr_en	18	RW	0	NA	hreset_n	Write+Read	0x00040000	0x00040000	0x00000000	0x00040000, 0x00000000	Write 1: Enable interrupt on falling edge. Write 0: Disable. Default is 0. PASS if field toggles correctly.	High	Functional Field Test	Standard RW field. Controls negative edge interrupt enable per GPIO pin.
GPIO_TP_026	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_level_sel_field	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify level_sel field (bit 19) in per-pin GPIO registers. Select GPIO pin signal level for interrupt generation.	gp0_gpio_8	0x00	32	level_sel	19	RW	0	NA	hreset_n	Write+Read	0x00080000	0x00080000	0x00000000	0x00080000, 0x00000000	Write 0: Generate interrupt on level 0. Write 1: Generate interrupt on level 1. Default is 0. PASS if field toggles correctly.	High	Functional Field Test	Standard RW field. Controls level-sensitive interrupt polarity per GPIO pin.
GPIO_TP_027	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_intr_clr_field	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify intr_clr field (bit 16) in per-pin GPIO registers. Write-only field to clear interrupt raw status.	gp0_gpio_8	0x00	32	intr_clr	16	WO	0	NA	NA	Write	0x00010000	0x00000000	NA	0x00010000	Writing 1 clears interrupt raw status. Writing 0 has no change. Field is write-only (read returns 0). PASS if write completes without error.	Medium	Functional Field Test	WO type: not readable. Used to clear interrupt raw status per GPIO pin.
GPIO_TP_028	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_data_in_field	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify data_in field (bit 0) in per-pin GPIO registers. Read-only field reflecting current GPIO pin level.	gp0_gpio_8	0x00	32	data_in	0	RO	0	gpio	hreset_n	Read	0x00000000	0x00000001	0x00000000	NA	Read returns current pin value regardless of input/output mode. PASS if read completes and returns valid 0 or 1.	Medium	Functional Field Test	RO type: sourced from gpio hardware module. Reflects real-time GPIO pin state.
GPIO_TP_029	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_group_io_ctrl	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify group IO control registers (gpio_io_ctrl_group1-4) allow simultaneous direction control of 8 GPIO pins with write mask support.	gpio_io_ctrl_group1	0x94	32	G8_io_ctrl to G15_io_ctrl, G8_io_wr_mask to G15_io_wr_mask	0-7, 16-23	VRRW	0	gpio	hreset_n	Write+Read	0x00FF00FF	0x00FF00FF	0x00000000	0x000000FF	Write io_ctrl bits [7:0] with mask bits [23:16]=0 to update all 8 GPIOs direction. PASS if group write propagates to individual registers.	Medium	Group Register Test	VRRW type. Skipped in main write-read loop (skip_array=1). Covers group1(0x94), group2(0x98), group3(0x9C), group4(0xA0).
GPIO_TP_030	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_group_dout	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify group data output registers (gpio_dout_group1-4) allow simultaneous output data control of 8 GPIO pins with write mask support.	gpio_dout_group1	0xA4	32	G8_dout to G15_dout, G8_dout_wr_mask to G15_dout_wr_mask	0-7, 16-23	VRRW	0	gpio	hreset_n	Write+Read	0x00FF00FF	0x00FF00FF	0x00000000	0x000000FF	Write dout bits [7:0] with mask bits [23:16]=0 to update all 8 GPIOs output. PASS if group write propagates to individual registers.	Medium	Group Register Test	VRRW type. Skipped in main write-read loop (skip_array=1). Covers group1(0xA4), group2(0xA8), group3(0xAC), group4(0xB0).
GPIO_TP_031	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_group_din	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify group data input registers (gpio_din_group1-4) return current input values for 8 GPIO pins simultaneously.	gpio_din_group1	0xB4	32	G8_din to G15_din	0-7	RO	0	gpio	hreset_n	Read	0x00000000	0x000000FF	0x00000000	NA	Read returns current input values for 8 GPIO pins. PASS if read completes and returns valid data.	Medium	Group Register Test	RO type. Covers group1(0xB4), group2(0xB8), group3(0xBC), group4(0xC0).
GPIO_TP_032	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_bus_interface	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify AHB bus interface for GPIO register block. Confirm 32-bit address bus width, burst-as-singles support, and proper bus protocol compliance.	gp0 (block)	0x00-0xC0	32	All	All	Mixed	Per spec	gpio	hreset_n	Read+Write	Per register	Per register	Per spec	All 6 patterns	All register accesses must complete without bus errors. AHB protocol must be followed. PASS if no bus errors detected.	High	Bus Interface Test	Register block: gp0. Bus type: AHB. Address bus width: 32. Support burst as singles: Yes. Clock: ahb_clk.
GPIO_TP_033	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_reset_behavior	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify hardware reset (hreset_n) correctly resets all GPIO registers to their default values. Active low asynchronous AHB reset.	All GP0 registers	0x00-0xC0	32	All	All	Mixed	Per spec	gpio	hreset_n	Reset+Read	NA	Per register	Per spec	NA	After hreset_n assertion and de-assertion, all registers must return to default values. PASS if all defaults match.	High	Reset Test	Reset signal: hreset_n. Type: Active low asynchronous. Interface reset: Yes. Applies to all registers in gp0 block.
GPIO_TP_034	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_lss_gpio0_intr	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify GPIO0 interrupt connectivity in LSS register space. Confirm gpio0_intr bit in raw_stcr1, intr_en1, and msk_sts1 registers.	raw_stcr1 (LSS)	0x24	32	gpio0_intr	1	RAWSTCR1lss	0	NA	hreset_n	Read	NA	0x00000002	0x00000000	NA	gpio0_intr bit[1] in LSS raw_stcr1 must reflect GPIO0 interrupt status. PASS if bit correctly reflects GPIO0 interrupt state.	Medium	System Integration	LSS-level interrupt register. gpio0_intr at bit 1. Also check intr_en1(0x28) bit 1 and msk_sts1(0x2C) bit 1.
GPIO_TP_035	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test_lss_gpio0_rst	GPIO	gpio_reg_wr_rd_test	Verify GPIO0 reset status in LSS register space. Confirm gpio0_rst_n bit in sts_1 register.	sts_1 (LSS)	0xF4	32	gpio0_rst_n	10	RO	1	lss_rsts	hreset_n	Read	NA	0x00000400	0x00000400	NA	gpio0_rst_n bit[10] in LSS sts_1 must be 1 after reset de-assertion. PASS if bit is 1 (reset released).	Medium	System Integration	LSS-level reset status register. gpio0_rst_n at bit 10. Source: lss_rsts. Default: 1 (not in reset).